PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_H0_0::
    .string "ACCURACY ROOM. In here, every\n"
    .string "attack lands. Every single one.$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_H0_1::
    .string "Yours landed harder.$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_H0_2::
    .string "Left door, DEFENSE ROOM. Right\n"
    .string "door, RECOVERY ROOM.\p"
    .string "Either way, they'll test how hard\n"
    .string "you can hit.$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_H1_0::
    .string "Move first and half the battle's\n"
    .string "done. That's the SPEED ROOM.$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_H1_1::
    .string "You were first where it counted.$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_H1_2::
    .string "Left, the CONFUSION ROOM.\n"
    .string "Right, the DEFENSE ROOM.$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_H2_0::
    .string "CONFUSION ROOM. If your POKéMON\n"
    .string "trust you, they'll find their way.$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_H2_1::
    .string "They found it. Every one.$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_H2_2::
    .string "The STRENGTH ROOM is next.\n"
    .string "Brace yourself.$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_H3_0::
    .string "With DEFENSE this high, I can\n"
    .string "afford to be reckless.$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_H3_1::
    .string "Not high enough, apparently.$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_H3_2::
    .string "Left, the STRENGTH ROOM. Right,\n"
    .string "the ONE-HIT KO ROOM.\p"
    .string "Both hit back. Hard.$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_H4_0::
    .string "RECOVERY ROOM. Just when you think\n"
    .string "you've won, I heal. Again.$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_H4_1::
    .string "I couldn't heal that fast.$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_H4_2::
    .string "NORMAN says a TRAINER's strength\n"
    .string "is earned, never given.\p"
    .string "You've earned plenty. The ONE-HIT\n"
    .string "KO ROOM is next.$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_H5_0::
    .string "NORMAN told us: go all out, even\n"
    .string "against KANTO's CHAMPION.\l"
    .string "Especially against KANTO's.$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_H5_1::
    .string "All out, and still out.$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_H5_2::
    .string "You battle like him, a little.\n"
    .string "Straight at the problem.\p"
    .string "Go on. The LEADER's waiting.$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_H6_0::
    .string "One good hit is all it takes in\n"
    .string "here. I'm not holding back.$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_H6_1::
    .string "One good hit. Yours.$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_H6_2::
    .string "NORMAN left JOHTO to build this\n"
    .string "GYM. I'd follow him anywhere.\p"
    .string "Give him the battle he's been\n"
    .string "waiting for.$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_H7::
    .string "SPEED ROOM\n"
    .string "“Whoever moves first.”$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_H8::
    .string "ACCURACY ROOM\n"
    .string "“Nothing misses.”$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_H9::
    .string "CONFUSION ROOM\n"
    .string "“Trust decides.”$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_H10::
    .string "DEFENSE ROOM\n"
    .string "“Hit it if you can.”$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_H11::
    .string "DEFENSE ROOM\n"
    .string "“Hit it if you can.”$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_H12::
    .string "RECOVERY ROOM\n"
    .string "“It isn't over till it's over.”$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_H13::
    .string "STRENGTH ROOM\n"
    .string "“Power, plainly.”$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_H14::
    .string "STRENGTH ROOM\n"
    .string "“Power, plainly.”$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_H15::
    .string "ONE-HIT KO ROOM\n"
    .string "“One is enough.”$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_H16::
    .string "ONE-HIT KO ROOM\n"
    .string "“One is enough.”$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_H17::
    .string "GYM LEADER'S ROOM\n"
    .string "“NORMAN is waiting.”$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_H18::
    .string "GYM LEADER'S ROOM\n"
    .string "“NORMAN is waiting.”$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_NormanFirst::
    .string "You'd be the TRAINER from KANTO.\n"
    .string "I'm NORMAN. This GYM is mine.\p"
    .string "I came here from JOHTO not long\n"
    .string "ago, so we're both new to HOENN.\p"
    .string "Your KANTO BADGES won't open these\n"
    .string "doors. HOENN's will.$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_NormanBadges0::
    .string "No HOENN BADGES yet. Bring me\n"
    .string "four, and I'll battle you myself.$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_NormanBadges1::
    .string "One HOENN BADGE. A start.\n"
    .string "Bring me four.$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_NormanBadges2::
    .string "Two BADGES. You're halfway. Keep\n"
    .string "going, and don't rush it.$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_NormanBadges3::
    .string "Three. One more, and these doors\n"
    .string "open for you. I'll be ready.$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_NormanPikachu::
    .string "That PIKACHU is watching you, not\n"
    .string "me. Good.\p"
    .string "A POKéMON that chooses its TRAINER\n"
    .string "is worth ten that are told to.$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_WallyExcuseMe::
    .string "WALLY: Um… Excuse me…\n"
    .string "Mr. NORMAN?$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_NormanHelloWally::
    .string "NORMAN: WALLY. Your father said\n"
    .string "you might come by.$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_WallyWantsPokemon::
    .string "WALLY: I'm going to stay with my\n"
    .string "cousin WANDA in VERDANTURF. For my\l"
    .string "health.\p"
    .string "I won't know anybody there.\p"
    .string "So I want a POKéMON. Just one.\n"
    .string "I'd look after it. I promise.$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_NormanLendsZigzagoon::
    .string "NORMAN: Then you'll have to catch\n"
    .string "one. Take my ZIGZAGOON and a\l"
    .string "POKé BALL.\p"
    .string "{PLAYER}, go with him to ROUTE 102.\n"
    .string "Keep an eye on him for me.$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_WallyPikachu::
    .string "WALLY: Your PIKACHU looks at you\n"
    .string "like you're its best friend…\p"
    .string "I want to be friends like that.$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_WallyThanks::
    .string "WALLY: Thank you, {PLAYER}.\n"
    .string "I'll give ZIGZAGOON back now.\p"
    .string "I'm leaving for VERDANTURF.\n"
    .string "RALTS is coming with me.\p"
    .string "When I'm stronger… would you\n"
    .string "battle me? A real one?$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_NormanAfter::
    .string "WALLY's gone on to VERDANTURF.\p"
    .string "That RALTS chose him as much as he\n"
    .string "chose it. He'll be all right.$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_NormanWallyWaiting::
    .string "WALLY is waiting on ROUTE 102.\n"
    .string "Please stay with him until he\l"
    .string "has caught his first partner.$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_NormanBadgesReady::
    .string "You've earned enough HOENN BADGES\n"
    .string "to challenge me.\p"
    .string "First, let's see WALLY safely\n"
    .string "through his first catch.$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_NormanBattleIntro::
    .string "NORMAN: You've kept your promise!\n"
    .string "Now we can battle as equals.\p"
    .string "Every journey changes a TRAINER.\n"
    .string "Show me what yours has taught you!$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_NormanDefeat::
    .string "You and your partners have grown\n"
    .string "strong together. I concede!$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_ReceivedBalanceBadge::
    .string "{PLAYER} received\n"
    .string "the BALANCE BADGE!$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_NormanTakeTM42::
    .string "Take this TM as well.\n"
    .string "It may help on the road ahead.$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_ReceivedTM42::
    .string "{PLAYER} received TM42\n"
    .string "from NORMAN.$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_NormanExplainTM42::
    .string "FACADE turns a status problem\n"
    .string "into extra power.\p"
    .string "Think about what your partner\n"
    .string "needs before choosing a move.$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_NormanNoRoom::
    .string "Your TM CASE can't hold another.\n"
    .string "Make room for TM42 and come back.$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_NormanPostBattle::
    .string "I came from JOHTO to make a new\n"
    .string "home here in HOENN.\p"
    .string "Every place has something to\n"
    .string "teach a TRAINER and their team.\p"
    .string "East of MAUVILLE, the road leads\n"
    .string "towards FORTREE's GYM.\p"
    .string "Keep learning from the people\n"
    .string "and POKéMON you meet.$"
